These notes predate the v3 rewrite and are kept only as history.

Everything on the original list is done:

- "que si ejecuto varias veces el mismo json no se modifique nada en el sistema"
  → the whole point of the v3 reconciler: plan/apply/import_state, a manifest per
    generation, and property-based tests that assert a second apply is a no-op.
- "ActionsHandler demasiado grande"
  → split into the action registry + Reconciler; the monolithic handler was
    deleted in PR #151.
- "sd-encrypt hooks innecesarios sin encriptación" and "la partición swap la
  encripta de manera innecesaria"
  → hooks are derived from the disk config (see dasik/lib/actions/initramfs/),
    and encryption is per-partition.
- "los paquetes deben tener la casuística de si están instalados asdeps o
  asexplicit"
  → PackagesAction runs `pacman -D --asdeps` / `--asexplicit` to reconcile the
    install reason (packages_action.py).

Open work is tracked in docs/improvement-review-2026-08-08.md and in the GitHub
issues/PRs, not here.
